==History==
2016
*The Tesla [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Rewards &amp; Card Balance Update]], increased the Tesla's damage by 7%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Tesla's hitpoints by 5%.
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Tesla's attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.7 seconds) and decreased its lifetime to 40 seconds (from 60 seconds).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12) and fixed the "range bug" and decreased the Tesla's range to 5.5 (from 6) but its effective range is unchanged.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Tesla's hitpoints by 5%.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Tesla's hitpoints by 8%.
2017
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], increased the Tesla's damage by 41% but increased its attack time interval to 1 second (from 0.8 seconds).
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Tesla from P.E.K.K.A.'s Playhouse to Electro Valley. It also fixed a bug where the Tesla would occasionally stop shooting at the edge of its range.
*On 6/8/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Tesla's lifetime to 35 seconds (from 40 seconds) and increased its attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1 second).
*On 3/12/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/12/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Tesla's first attack interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.7 seconds).
2019
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], changed the Tesla's card image.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Tesla's card info screen.
2020
*On 3/3/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/3/2020)|Balance Update]], allowed the [[Earthquake]] to affect the Tesla even if it is hidden.
2021
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the Tesla's lifetime to 30 seconds (from 35 seconds).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], increased the Tesla's attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Tesla from Electro Valley to Hog Mountain.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 8/8/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/8/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Tesla's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds).
2024
*On 4/3/2024, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/3/2024)|March 2024 Update]], added the Tesla's Evolution.
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], fixed a bug with Tesla's behavior when it is frozen during deployment.
*On 2/7/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Tesla’s damage by 4% and increased its Tesla’s attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds).
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Tesla’s attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds).

